  m_Name: Spawn_FloorEffects
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HelpTopicSO
  category: Boss Abilities
  title: Spawn FE's
  description: The boss will spawn multiple floor effects on the board. They can
    be spawned individually scattered across the board or in patterns of 2x2, 1x4,
    or 4x1. Possible floor effect types are posion, fire, and lightning.
